          <path class="tfa-roar-lick tfa-roar-lick--b" d="M194 150 C188 124 200 106 199 82 C198 72 204 70 203 62 C208 76 210 98 208 114 C210 130 210 140 205 150 C202 153 197 153 194 150 Z"></path>
