            <blockquote class="tfa-seq-quote">"That boy calls you father. Do not bear a hand in his death." Okonkwo was surprised, and was about to say something when the old man continued: "Yes, Umuofia has decided to kill him. The Oracle of the Hills and the Caves has pronounced it… But I want you to have nothing to do with it. He calls you his father."</blockquote>
